cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ToolSurf in research, products, or security assessments, please cite it as below."
title: ToolSurf
abstract: >-
  ToolSurf is an open-source security audit platform for AI agents and tool
  interfaces. It normalizes MCP servers, REST/OpenAPI, GraphQL, gRPC, A2A,
  OpenAI function calling, and LangChain tools into a single analysis engine
  with 39 audit modules, active probing, risk scoring, and compliance mapping.
